```console
$ scherzo-cloud artifact download --help
Download and verify a run's Artifact Set

Usage: scherzo-cloud artifact download [OPTIONS] --output <PATH> <ORGANIZATION> <RUN>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug
  <RUN>           Run identifier containing the Artifact Set

Options:
      --output <PATH>        Directory to create for the complete Artifact Set (must not already exist)
      --allow-insecure-http  Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                 Print help

```
